;    1: TDecorate(count=8, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=いとひめやま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ゆ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=じみ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=234, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=20, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=た, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=151, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=3912, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=3537, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\山1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―I stayed up way too late last night.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd been aware of the sunlight piercing my eyelids for hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my sleepiness was strong too, and I'd been stuck in the middle of a tug-of-war between sleep and waking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And at last the tug-of-war is settled, and I open my eyes.<PG>
Nnn... I stretch out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once it's April, it really is warm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'In spring, one sleeps on past the dawn'―whoever said that had it right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even living this survival life, when I'm sleepy, I'm sleepy.<PG>
Today... 
{PAUSE ""}
maybe I'll go a little closer to the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shiyo 802, April 8 is <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>'s third-year memorial service.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm on the mountain seclusion, so I won't attend, but I want to know whether the memorial service is held properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether the merit-adding prayers for <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> will be said properly.<PG>
By the angle of the sun, it must be about 8 now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From here to the settlement is about an hour on my feet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looks like I have time for a bath and a meal.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\雲を乗り継ぐ冒険.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\山2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Until just recently, this area was a pure white, bleak mountain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had to compare it to something, I'd call it the mountain's bleached skeleton.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that mountain is reborn again, and sprouts new life like this.<PG>
During the mountain seclusion, I have to stay here on <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="いとひめやま">Mount Itohime</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, that means being in the mountains through the cold winter, too...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Actually, here on <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="いとひめやま">Mount Itohime</STYLE>, there's a secret for getting through the winter.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\温泉.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Steam billowing up off the water's surface.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is Mount Itohime's hidden hot spring: Itohime Hot Spring (named by me).
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I strip right away and dive straight into the steam.
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂飛込み.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
At first it's a little hot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But only at first. I soon get used to it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I'm used to it, it's not quite enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I move a little upstream and hunt down the most comfortable temperature.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I've found it, I float on the surface at some good spot.<PG>
What was the mountain seclusion again...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I'm soaking in Itohime Hot Spring, I forget what the mountain seclusion is for.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Soaking in hot water: 'Heaven, pure heaven'―they got that one right too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even the harshest event of the mountain seclusion, "winter," is powerless before this hot spring.<PG>
Apparently, for hundreds of years, women on the mountain seclusion have warmed themselves in this hot spring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And strangely, this hot spring never leaves you chilled after the bath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If you take your time soaking, not only do you warm up to the core, of course, but your body stays warm for about half a day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In winter it's like hugging an invisible hot-water bottle, and in summer you keep sweating lightly, which cools you down.<PG>
And once you get even more used to it, just a short soak keeps your body warm for a long time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It remakes you into a body that never gets cold.<PG>
I may be on the mountain seclusion, but I'm still a woman, more or less.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't want to get dirty if I can help it, and if I can be clean, I want to be.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if to satisfy those womanly desires, it gives my skin moisture, my hair shine, and my heart peace.<PG>
The mountain seclusion doesn't need survival training meant for the Himalayas or the Alps.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As long as you can survive in Arata, that's enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So enjoying this hot spring counts as a proper mountain seclusion too.<PG>
Well, time to eat and head for the settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\温泉川上.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I get dressed, go upstream of the hot spring, and pull out what I'd sunk in the spring's source.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\ウサギ肉.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This is rabbit meat wrapped in leaves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's tasty grilled too, but if you crush the early-spring nuts that grow wild around here, coat it in them, and <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ゆ">boil</STYLE> it overnight in the hot spring, it picks up a solid saltiness and flavor and comes out tender and delicious.<PG>
This way, the leaves keep the fat and savoriness from escaping, and the hot spring's salt seasons it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I used to think rabbit meat was pretty much like chicken.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But cooked this way, you can clearly tell the difference between chicken and rabbit.<PG>
No, maybe the difference in taste is because it's a rabbit caught in Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="じみ">rich flavor</STYLE> of these rabbits is really wonderful too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A rabbit raised in the Arata mountains versus broiler chicken: of course they taste different.<PG>
At first, I was a little uneasy about the meat's <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ゆ">boiling</STYLE> water flowing down to where I bathe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, once you're used to that, it's no big deal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A river, after flowing for just 30 seconds, is reborn as clean water through its natural self-cleaning.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Okay, now once I brush my teeth with softened wood fiber, I'm ready to go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Morning bath, meal, brushing my teeth. A morning no different from my high school days.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\山1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Now I'll run this mountain path for about an hour, back to the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These days my athletic ability is close to <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE>'s and <STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE>'s, so I'm not worried about getting tired.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I'll take my knife.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I find game on the way back, it'll be tonight's food.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\hito_ge_run_kusa01.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\林走る.gal" "NORMAL" "32" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―My body feels lighter than I expected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "10000" "PASS"}
The mountain path that was buried in snow has melted completely thanks to the clear skies of the last few days, with no mud, just solid, sturdy ground.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe thanks to the warm spring air, my heart feels light too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd figured an hour, but I'll probably make it in 45 minutes.<PG>
I brought just a few books with me to Mount Itohime.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE> advised me to bring something I could read out loud.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE> did her mountain seclusion, she went on living without using her voice, so her voice gave out completely, and apparently for a while she could barely hold a conversation.<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The settlement should be close by now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sit on a branch of a cedar a little way from the settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From here, I can see the settlement well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's my first time here in 2 years, but it doesn't look like much has changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can tell people are walking around, but...<PG>
Actually, there's no real need to sneak around, is there?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Staying in the mountains for 2 years was my own decision, and I've done the required year, so it'd be fine to show my face...<PG>
But suddenly showing up is a little embarrassing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all, it's been 2 years, and whether it's <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE>, what am I supposed to say when I see them...<PG>
Okay, I'll try climbing onto the roof of the meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Up there, people won't spot me easily.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集集会所.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I head for the meeting hall, hiding in the shadows of trees and houses.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no reason to hide in the first place, but I'm avoiding people just because I hadn't planned to see anyone.<PG>
Huh? There are people around, but everyone's dressed normally...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nobody's wearing a Noh mask or red robes...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today's April 8, right?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集会場屋根.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Climbing onto the meeting hall's roof without being seen was no trouble at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's my first time up on the meeting hall's roof, but it's been cleaned nicely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hardly any fallen leaves or dust have <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="た">piled up</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone must have climbed up on this roof recently.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so...<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
There's no sign of anyone in this meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By the angle of the sun, it's already past 10.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The third-year memorial service was supposed to start at 10...<PG>
And how should I put it... 
{PAUSE ""}
the settlement's mood is a little off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't explain it well, but the air feels somehow uneasy.<PG>
―Maybe I should change my plan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I need to know what's going on in this settlement now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll make contact with someone and ask why they're not holding the third-year memorial service, and why the mood is a little strange.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly, a voice right behind me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Up on the roof without letting me sense a thing, and standing right behind me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But given whose voice it is, that makes sense.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... I knew it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. Your hair's gotten so long."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, you're back!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, welcome back to you. The mountain seclusion must have been really hard."</STYLE><PG>
My first conversation with another person in 2 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before we met I'd felt a little awkward, but now that we're actually face to face, that feeling blew away in an instant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> turns 22 this year, right?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure enough, she's come to resemble <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not just her looks, but the way she talks and her air too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, how come they're not doing the third-year memorial service today?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, let's go somewhere else."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Huh? Oh, yeah, you're right. Standing around talking on the meeting hall's roof is weird."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... Then follow me. I know a good place."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> climbs down from the roof quietly, so as not to make a sound.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's up with her? She could just jump off the roof like usual...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And she doesn't look hurt...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集集会所.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just in case, I climb down slowly too, without a sound, the same as <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
While I was climbing down, <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> kept glancing all around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if she were worried about being seen.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, follow me. I know a good place to talk."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Can't we just talk inside a house or something?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> doesn't answer my question and starts running.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something's definitely off.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "6000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Maybe she's trying not to be seen with me?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\廃屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
