{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you're hardly recognizable yourself, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"But come on... why'd we come all the way out here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No sign of people or animals; only spring birds chirping in the distance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is clearly avoiding being seen.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... Come on, go inside."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
